00:49:17.775 --> 00:49:18.525
KAISER: All right.

00:49:18.525 --> 00:49:20.358
GOLDMAN: But I definitely
will stay in touch

00:49:20.358 --> 00:49:22.340
with all of my friends.

00:49:22.340 --> 00:49:24.230
KAISER: OK, Kenny?

00:49:24.230 --> 00:49:25.270
LEE: Yeah, go ahead.

00:49:25.270 --> 00:49:29.000
KAISER: I want you to, on
