00:49:29.000 --> 00:49:32.240
and all of your friends
wave to all of their friends

00:49:32.240 --> 00:49:34.490
and parents here
in Killian Court.

00:49:34.490 --> 00:49:35.040
1--

00:49:35.040 --> 00:49:36.790
LEE: Well, actually,
can I just interrupt?

00:49:36.790 --> 00:49:39.559
We've been working on a move
for the past three days--

00:49:39.559 --> 00:49:40.850
KAISER: Excellent, let's do it.

00:49:40.850 --> 00:49:41.940
LEE: --perfecting it.

00:49:41.940 --> 00:49:44.080
On the count of three,
