of Mechanical Engineering.

03:06:40.030 --> 03:06:45.100
Matthew N. Styczynzki,
treasurer of the Class of 2004,

03:06:45.100 --> 03:06:47.380
is awarded the degrees
of Bachelor of Science

03:06:47.380 --> 03:06:52.230
in Economics and Bachelor
of Science in Mathematics.

03:06:52.230 --> 03:06:57.000
R. Erich Caulfield, president
of the Graduate Student Council,

03:06:57.000 --> 03:07:00.910
is pursuing the degree
of Doctor of Philosophy.

03:07:00.910 --> 03:07:03.820
Michael R. Folkert,
vice president

03:07:03.820 --> 03:07:06.790
of the Graduate Student
Council, is pursuing the degree

03:07:06.790 --> 03:07:08.312
of Doctor of Philosophy.

03:07:10.970 --> 03:07:12.621
Bachelor of Science
diplomas will now

03:07:12.621 --> 03:07:14.870
be presented to students in
