PRESENTER: Advanced
degree diplomas

03:07:26.300 --> 03:07:27.770
will now be
presented to students

03:07:27.770 --> 03:07:29.600
in the School of
Architecture and Planning

03:07:29.600 --> 03:07:32.480
who have completed the
specified degree requirements.

